<title>NETHERLANDS: Unigro 1996/97 net rises 28 percent.</title>
<headline>Unigro 1996/97 net rises 28 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    32.2  vs  25.2</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		   4.25 vs   4.12</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    61.5  vs  56.3</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charges		1.2  vs   6.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Supermarkets and wholesale group Unigro NV is being merged with retailer De Boer Winkelbedrijven NV.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
